# TryHackMe — Pre Security: Hands-On Portfolio

**Status:** ✅ Completed
**Qualification:** TryHackMe SEC0
**Focus:** Practical technical foundations for cybersecurity

This section contains a **curated selection of the most relevant hands-on work** completed during the TryHackMe Pre Security pathway.

Rather than documenting every learning room, I have selected practical exercises that demonstrate the foundations most relevant to my ongoing development in IT and cybersecurity.

The objective is to show **what I actually interacted with and practised**, rather than simply listing completed training.

